{#
  Shared app-page nav — Site Redesign Reset, Phase 1, nav content
  flattened in Phase 2. Replaces three hand-copied <nav class="site-nav">
  blocks (dashboard/sentiment/stock templates) with one source. Two
  genuine bugs/gaps were fixed in Phase 1, both already decided rather
  than assumed: the brand link on stock_template.html pointed at
  dashboard.html instead of index.html (every other page points home;
  no reason found for stock to differ, treated as a bug) and
  stock_template.html had no nav-auth element at all (Phase 3's "finish
  accounts everywhere" decision requires it). Sentiment's search box
  (Phase 2) now shows the same markup as the other two pages -- the JS
  that powers it lives in sentiment_template.html itself, ported from
  dashboard_template.html's version and adapted to call this page's own
  openChartModal() directly (sentiment has no global [data-ticker] click
  delegation the way dashboard does).

  Dashboard/Sentiment split (2026-08-23): the dashboard's "Signals" link
  used to jump to its own #signals-block -- that section (and "Today's
  Market Read" above it) moved wholesale to sentiment_template.html, so
  this now points cross-page at sentiment.html's new #signal-feed-block
  instead of a same-page anchor that no longer exists.

  Nav label is plain "Sentiment" (Phase 4B: "Intelligence" reserved for
  the brand-level tagline only, per SITE_REDESIGN_RESET.md's copy audit
  -- it was overloading five unrelated things across the site).

  Params:
    active_page: 'dashboard' | 'sentiment' | 'stock'
#}
<nav class="site-nav">
  <a class="site-brand" href="index.html">
    <div class="site-brand-mark">
      <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none">
        <path d="M4,20 C8,11 12,11 16,17.5 C20,24 24,24 28,13" stroke="#3B82F6" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <span class="site-brand-word">UNDERTOW</span>
  </a>
  {% if active_page == 'dashboard' %}
  <div class="site-nav-links" id="quicknav">
    <a href="#markets-strip">Markets</a>
    <a href="#news-condensed">News</a>
    <a href="sentiment.html#signal-feed-block" id="nav-signals">Signals</a>
    <a href="sentiment.html">Sentiment</a>
    <a href="about.html" class="nav-secondary">About</a>
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <div class="site-nav-links">
    <a href="dashboard.html">Dashboard</a>
    <a href="sentiment.html"{% if active_page == 'sentiment' %} class="active" aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Sentiment</a>
    <a href="about.html" class="nav-secondary">About</a>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="nav-search">
    <span class="nav-search-icon">⌕</span>
    <input type="text" id="nav-search-input" placeholder="Search ticker or company..." autocomplete="off">
    <div class="nav-search-results" id="nav-search-results"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="nav-auth" id="nav-auth"></div>
</nav>
